Rule 3 (all elements of base tensor must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (axis must be within the valid range of the broadcasted shape of start and stop tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then v_3 ≥ 0 - ndim(v_1) - 1 ∧ v_3 ≤ ndim(v_1) else v_3 ≥ 0 - ndim(v_2) - 1 ∧ v_3 ≤ ndim(v_2)
>>
Rule 8 (axis must be within the valid range of dimensions of the start tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 ≥ 0 - ndim(v_1) - 1 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 9 (output dtype of logspace must not be boolean or string)
{v_1 : dtype} |= v_1 ≠ 0 ∧ v_1 ≠ 11
>>
Rule 10 (start and stop tensors must have matching shapes if they have the same rank)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
